---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import TimeLineElement from "../components/cv/TimeLine.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="CV" sideBarActiveItemID="cv">
  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Profil</div>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-10 text-justify">
    I build and operate production-grade multi-agent systems and Generative AI platforms.
    <br><br>
    Specialized in agentic architectures, hybrid RAG, local & cloud LLM pipelines, and end-to-end Generative AI applications. Strong industrial Computer Vision and MLOps background. Focus on reliability, cost control, and real business impact.
    <br><br>
    Stack : Python, LangGraph, Azure, Docker, CI/CD
    <br>
    From Architecture to Production
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Experiences</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Senior AI Engineer"
      subtitle="Since 2026, Freelance"
    >
<u>Expert in agentic architectures</u><br>
• Design and ship production-grade multi-agent systems and end-to-end Generative AI platforms, from architecture to deployment and operation.<br>
• Stateful orchestration, collaborative AI crews (sequential & hierarchical), tool-calling agents, and long-running workflows.<br>
• Build advanced RAG systems (hybrid vector + full-text retrieval with RRF fusion) and cost-aware LLM pipelines (local & cloud).<br>
• Develop self-hosted AI platforms running entirely on private infrastructure (multi-GPU), combining conversational interfaces, image generation (Flux), specialized agents, and granular administration.<br>
• Strong background in Computer Vision and Deep Learning (detection, classification, OCR, anomaly detection, tracking) applied to industrial and real-world use cases.<br>
<u>Full ownership of the AI lifecycle</u><br>
• System design, prompt & agent engineering, evaluation, MLOps, CI/CD, and production monitoring on Azure.<br>
<u>Deliver measurable business impact</u><br>
• Significant reductions in manual workload, revenue uplift, and operational acceleration across content, e-commerce, customs, and legal domains.<br>
<u>Tech stack</u><br>
• Python, FastAPI, LangGraph / agent frameworks, Azure OpenAI, Ollama, Docker, React/TypeScript, hybrid RAG stacks, multi-GPU orchestration.<br>
    </TimeLineElement>

    <TimeLineElement
      title="AI Engineer"
      subtitle="From 2023 to 2026 at EXAKIS NELITE, Lyon, France"
    >
    <u>Generative AI & Intelligent Agents</u><br>
• Development of custom GPTs and APIs for intelligent agents (Agentic AI)<br>
• Implementation of RAG pipelines (Azure Search, CosmosDB, OpenAI) to answer business queries from internal documents.<br>
• Creation of Azure Function Skills to enrich cognitive search flows.<br>
• Infrastructure as Code (Bicep), YAML CI/CD pipelines, Docker, continuous deployment on Azure.<br>

<u>Model Context Protocol (MCP) Server Development</u><br>
• Design and implementation of MCP servers to expose business capabilities as tools consumable by LLM agents.<br>
• Integration with Azure OpenAI and FastAPI to enable rich contextual interactions.<br>
• Contribution to the agentic ecosystem: standardization of tool calls, session management, authentication.<br>

<u>Industrial Computer Vision</u><br>
• Design of an anomaly and defect detection system based on PaDiM (patch distribution modeling) for quality inspection. <br>
• Experimentation on real data, optimization of accuracy and inference speed.<br>
• Flame detection and localization using image processing (OpenCV, Python) for fire safety systems.<br>
    </TimeLineElement>
    
    <TimeLineElement
      title="AI Engineer, Full Stack developer"
      subtitle="From 2021 to 2023 at Mediatouch, Perpignan, France"
    >
    <u>AI Model Development:</u><br>
    • Designed and implemented machine learning architectures for license plate recognition, including supervised training and character assembly algorithms. <br>
    <u>Data Pipeline Management:</u><br>
    • Collected, cleaned, preprocessed, and augmented large datasets to ensure high-quality training inputs. <br>
    <u>User Interaction:</u><br>
    • Built and deployed a user-friendly interface to facilitate seamless interaction with the AI recognition system.<br>
    <u>Performance Optimization:</u><br>
    • Improved accuracy and robustness through iterative model refinement and data-driven experimentation <br>
    <u>API Development:</u><br>
    • Designed and implemented robust APIs to support system functionality and integration.<br>
    <u>Web Application Development:</u><br>
    • Built and maintained scalable web applications with a focus on performance and usability.<br>
    <u>Quality Assurance:</u><br>
    • Conducted unit and integration testing to ensure reliability, functionality, and code quality <br>
      <b><a 
          href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=25r-kjp4JbQ" target="_blank"
          class="mx-3"
          aria-label="SC PLATE READER"
          title="Demo"
          >Demo</a></b> <br>
    </TimeLineElement>

    <TimeLineElement
      title="C++ Developer"
      subtitle="From 2019 to 2021, Freelance"
    >
    • Developed graphical plugins and dynamic modules (DLLs) designed to extend and enhance existing applications.<br>
    • Intercepted and instrumented GPU rendering pipelines to inject graphical layers, overlays, and real-time visualization tools.<br>
    • Strong expertise in modern C++, plugin architecture, Windows internals, and low-level performance optimization.<br>
    • Designed highly integrated graphical interfaces and components with minimal impact on the host application’s performance.<br>
    </TimeLineElement>

  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Education</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container grid gap-4 mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement
      title="MASTER 2, Computer Engineering (M2)"
      subtitle="2020 to 2023 at IMERIR, Perpignan, France"
    >
    EDUCATION FOCUS AREAS : <br>
    • Computer Science <br>
    • Robotics <br>
    • Management and Engineering Culture <br> <br>

    ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE OPTION : <br>
    • Artificial Intelligence <br>
    • Machine Learning <br>
    • Expert Systems <br>
    
    </TimeLineElement>

    <TimeLineElement
      title="BTEC Higher National Diploma in Computer Science (HND)"
      subtitle="2017 to 2019 at Lycée Georges Brassens, Rive-de-Giers, France"
    >
      • Object-oriented application development <br>
      • Networking of computer and telecommunications systems <br>
    </TimeLineElement>
  </div>
  
  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Skills</div>
  </div>

  <ul class="list-disc md:columns-5 columns-2 mx-6">
    <li>Python</li>
    <li>LangChain, LangGraph, LangSmith</li>
    <li>Azure</li>
    <li>Docker</li>
    <li>CI/CD</li>
  </ul>
</BaseLayout>
